[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m But we want $ bc $, so:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m bc = \frac{abc}{a} = \frac{312s}{a}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m We also know:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m s = \frac{a + b + c}{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m bc = \frac{312 \cdot \frac{a + b + c}{2}}{a} = \frac{156(a + b + c)}{a}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Now, we can use the identity:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m a^2 = b^2 + c^2 - bc
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \Rightarrow a^2 = b^2 + c^2 - bc
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Let’s try to find $ bc $ numerically.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m We have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ R = 13 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ r = 6 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ IA = 2\sqrt{39} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ OI = \sqrt{13} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ AO = 13 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Let’s try to compute $ bc $ using the formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
