[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m bc = \frac{4 \cdot 13 \cdot 6}{\frac{1}{2}} = \frac{312}{\frac{1}{2}} = 624
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
