[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 3: Find $BD^2$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m The coordinates of $B = (-b, a)$ and $D = (b, -a)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m BD^2 = (-b - b)^2 + (a - (-a))^2 = (-2b)^2 + (2a)^2 = 4b^2 + 4a^2 = 4(a^2 + b^2)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
