[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 4: Use the Hyperbola Equation to Relate $a$ and $b$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m From equation (1):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
