[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Now solve for $a^2$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m a^2 = \frac{5}{6}(24 + b^2) = 20 + \frac{5b^2}{6}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Now plug this into $BD^2 = 4(a^2 + b^2)$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
