[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 1: Set up equations
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Let’s define:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ t $ is in **minutes**, so we'll convert everything to minutes for consistency.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - The total walking distance is 9 km.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - At speed $ s $ km/h, the time taken is 4 hours = $ 4 \times 60 = 240 $ minutes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - At speed $ s + 2 $ km/h, the time taken is 2 hours 24 minutes = $ 2 \times 60 + 24 = 144 $ minutes.
