[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 2: Use the distance = speed × time formula
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m **First scenario:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 9 = s \times 240 \Rightarrow s = \frac{9}{240} = \frac{3}{80} \text{ km/min}
