[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Thus, the diagonals are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $AC = 2a$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $BD = 2b$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
