[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 3: Plug in the Coordinates into the Hyperbola Equation
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Let’s plug in the coordinates of the points into the hyperbola equation to find conditions on $a$ and $b$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m #### For point $A = (-a, 0)$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \frac{(-a)^2}{20} - \frac{0^2}{24} = \frac{a^2}{20} = 1 \Rightarrow a^2 = 20 \Rightarrow a = \sqrt{20}
