[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 6: Use the Hyperbola Condition
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Let’s denote:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $A = \left( \frac{v_x}{2}, \frac{v_y}{2} \right)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $B = \left( \frac{w_x}{2}, \frac{w_y}{2} \right)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $C = \left( \frac{3v_x}{2}, \frac{3v_y}{2} \right)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $D = \left( \frac{3w_x}{2}, \frac{3w_y}{2} \right)$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Plug each into the hyperbola equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m #### For point $A$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \frac{\left( \frac{v_x}{2} \right)^2}{20} - \frac{\left( \frac{v_y}{2} \right)^2}{24} = 1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \Rightarrow \frac{v_x^2}{80} - \frac{v_y^2}{96} = 1 \tag{1}
