[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \Rightarrow \frac{w_x^2}{80} - \frac{w_y^2}{96} = 1 \tag{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Now, we have two equations for $v$ and $w$.
