[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 1: Use the fact that $ \overline{IA} \perp \overline{OI} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m This is a key geometric condition. Let's denote:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ I $ as the incenter of triangle $ ABC $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ O $ as the circumcenter of triangle $ ABC $
