[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ R = 13 $ (circumradius)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ r = 6 $ (inradius)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Let’s recall the formula for the **distance between the incenter and circumcenter** in a triangle:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m OI^2 = R^2 - 2Rr
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
