[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 3: Use the right triangle formed by $ I, O, A $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m We are told that $ \overline{IA} \perp \overline{OI} $, so triangle $ IAO $ is a right triangle with:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
