[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ AC = b $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ BC = a $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m We know:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ R = 13 $, so $ a = 2R \sin A = 26 \sin A $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ b = 2R \sin B = 26 \sin B $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ c = 2R \sin C = 26 \sin C $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So, $ AB \cdot AC = bc = (26 \sin B)(26 \sin C) = 676 \sin B \sin C $
