[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 4: Use the identity for $ \sin B \sin C $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m We know that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \sin B \sin C = \frac{1}{2} \left[ \cos(B - C) - \cos(B + C) \right]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
