[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So, $ AO^2 = x^2 + 13 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Now, we also know that in triangle $ ABC $, the **distance from the circumcenter to a vertex** is the circumradius $ R = 13 $, so:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m AO = R = 13
