[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So, $ IA = 2\sqrt{39} $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ---
