[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 7: Use the formula for the inradius
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m The inradius $ r $ is given by:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
