[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ A $ is the area of triangle $ ABC $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ s $ is the semiperimeter
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Also, the formula for the inradius in terms of the circumradius and angles is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
