[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m We are to assign each of the 9 players to one of three flavors: chocolate (C), vanilla (V), or strawberry (S), such that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - Each flavor is used **at least once**.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - The number of players who chose chocolate > number who chose vanilla > number who chose strawberry.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Let:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ c $ = number of players who chose chocolate
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ v $ = number of players who chose vanilla
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ s $ = number of players who chose strawberry
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m We are given:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ c + v + s = 9 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ c > v > s \geq 1 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ c, v, s \in \mathbb{Z}^+ $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m We are to count the number of **assignments** of flavors to players that satisfy these constraints.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 2: Find All Valid Triplets $ (c, v, s) $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m We need to find all triplets $ (c, v, s) $ such that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ c > v > s \geq 1 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ c + v + s = 9 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Let’s list all such triplets.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Start with $ s = 1 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ s = 1 $, then $ v \geq 2 $, $ c \geq 3 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ c + v + s = 9 \Rightarrow c + v = 8 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - Try $ v = 2 \Rightarrow c = 6 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ v = 3 \Rightarrow c = 5 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ v = 4 \Rightarrow c = 4 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ v = 5 \Rightarrow c = 3 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ v = 6 \Rightarrow c = 2 $ → invalid since $ c < v $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So for $ s = 1 $, valid triplets are:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ (6, 2, 1) $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ (5, 3, 1) $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ (4, 4, 1) $ → invalid (not strictly increasing)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ (4, 3, 1) $ → $ c = 4 $, $ v = 3 $, $ s = 1 $ → $ c > v > s $ ✅
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So valid triplets for $ s = 1 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ (6, 2, 1) $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ (5, 3, 1) $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ (4, 3, 1) $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Now try $ s = 2 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ s = 2 $, $ v \geq 3 $, $ c \geq 4 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ c + v = 9 - 2 = 7 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - Try $ v = 3 \Rightarrow c = 4 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ v = 4 \Rightarrow c = 3 $ → invalid (c < v)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ v = 5 \Rightarrow c = 2 $ → invalid
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So only valid triplet is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ (4, 3, 2) $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Now try $ s = 3 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ s = 3 $, $ v \geq 4 $, $ c \geq 5 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ c + v = 9 - 3 = 6 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ v \geq 4 \Rightarrow c \leq 2 $ → invalid
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So no valid triplets for $ s \geq 3 $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
