[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 3: List All Valid Triplets
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m From above:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Valid triplets $ (c, v, s) $ such that $ c > v > s \geq 1 $ and $ c + v + s = 9 $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ (6, 2, 1) $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ (5, 3, 1) $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ (4, 3, 1) $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ (4, 3, 2) $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
