[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Multiply both sides by $ s $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 9 = 4s - \frac{st}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
