[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 4: Second scenario: $ s + 2 $ km/h
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m She walks 9 km at speed $ s + 2 $, takes 2 hours and 24 minutes = 144 minutes = 2.4 hours.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
