[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 5: Now we have two equations:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 1. $ 9 = 4s - \frac{st}{60} $   --- (1)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 2. $ 9 = 2.4(s + 2) - \frac{t(s + 2)}{60} $   --- (2)
