[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 6: Solve equation (1) for $ t $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m From (1):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 9 = 4s - \frac{st}{60}
