[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Multiply both sides by 60 to eliminate denominator:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 540 = 240s - st
