[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Expand the right-hand side:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 9b + 7 = kb + 7k
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Now bring all terms to one side:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
