[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m From the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \frac{a^2}{20} - \frac{b^2}{24} = 1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
