[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m We can use the **division algorithm**:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 9b + 7 = q(b + 7) + r
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
