[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 3: Use the Hyperbola Equation
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Each vertex lies on the hyperbola. So we substitute the coordinates into the hyperbola equation.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - For point $A = (a, 0)$:
