[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 5: Use the Hyperbola Condition
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m For each vertex, the coordinates must satisfy the hyperbola equation.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 1. For point $A = (x_1, y_1)$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m    $$
