[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m First, compute $ BD $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m BD = \sqrt{(-2c)^2 + (-2d)^2} = \sqrt{4c^2 + 4d^2} = 2\sqrt{c^2 + d^2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
