[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 5: Use vector or coordinate geometry to find $AB \cdot AC$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Let’s consider a triangle with incenter $I$, circumcenter $O$, and vertex $A$.
