[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m But it is **a special case** of a triangle where the incenter lies on the perpendicular to the circumcenter at the vertex.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
