[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m We have the formula:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m IA^2 = r^2 + \left( \frac{b + c - a}{2} \right)^2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
