[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m We already found $IA^2 = 156$, $r = 6$, so:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 156 = 6^2 + \left( \frac{b + c - a}{2} \right)^2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \Rightarrow 156 = 36 + \left( \frac{b + c - a}{2} \right)^2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \Rightarrow \left( \frac{b + c - a}{2} \right)^2 = 120
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \Rightarrow \frac{b + c - a}{2} = \sqrt{120}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \Rightarrow b + c - a = 2\sqrt{120}
