[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \Rightarrow x_2 + x_3 + \cdots + x_{11} = 20
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m x_2 + x_3 + \cdots + x_{11} = 20
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m We also know that:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m x_i x_{i+1} = \frac{26}{5} \quad \text{for } i = 2, \ldots, 10
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Let’s denote $ x_2 = a $, $ x_3 = b $, ..., $ x_{11} = x $.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m a b = \frac{26}{5}, \quad b c = \frac{26}{5}, \quad c d = \frac{26}{5}, \ldots, x_{10} x = \frac{26}{5}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So we can write:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m x_2 = a, \quad x_3 = \frac{26}{5a}, \quad x_4 = \frac{26}{5x_3} = \frac{26}{5 \cdot \frac{26}{5a}} = a
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So we get a repeating pattern:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m x_2 = a, \quad x_3 = \frac{26}{5a}, \quad x_4 = a, \quad x_5 = \frac{26}{5a}, \ldots
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So the sequence is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m a, \frac{26}{5a}, a, \frac{26}{5a}, a, \frac{26}{5a}, a, \frac{26}{5a}, a, \frac{26}{5a}, a
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m That is, the pattern is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m a, \frac{26}{5a}, a, \frac{26}{5a}, a, \frac{26}{5a}, a, \frac{26}{5a}, a, \frac{26}{5a}, a
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So the sum is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \text{Sum} = 10a + 1 \cdot \frac{26}{5a} = 20
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Let’s solve for $ a $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 10a + \frac{26}{5a} = 20
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Multiply both sides by $ 5a $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 50a^2 + 26 = 100a
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \Rightarrow 50a^2 - 100a + 26 = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Solve this quadratic:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
