[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m q^2 = \frac{120}{6 - 5m^2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So, both $p^2$ and $q^2$ are equal, so $p = q$.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Thus, the diagonals are of equal length, and the rhombus is **a square** (since diagonals are equal and perpendicular).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So, the rhombus is a **square** inscribed in the hyperbola.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
