[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 6: Find $BD^2$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m The diagonals are of length $2p$ and $2q$, and since $p = q$, the diagonals are equal.
