[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So, the diagonals are of length $2p$, and the side of the square is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \text{Side} = \frac{\text{Diagonal}}{\sqrt{2}} = \frac{2p}{\sqrt{2}} = \sqrt{2} p
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m But we are asked to find $BD^2$, where $B = (q, mq)$, and $D = (-q, -mq)$.
