[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m #### From (1):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m s = \frac{9}{4 - x} \quad \text{(3)}
