[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 21.6 - 9x = 16.8 + 5.4x
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Solve for $ x $:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 21.6 - 16.8 = 9x + 5.4x \Rightarrow 4.8 = 14.4x \Rightarrow x = \frac{4.8}{14.4} = \frac{1}{3}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So $ x = \frac{1}{3} $ hours = $ \frac{1}{3} \times 60 = 20 $ minutes
