[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m and a **rhombus** $ABCD$ inscribed in this hyperbola, with **diagonals intersecting at the origin**.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
