[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \frac{c^2}{20} - \frac{d^2}{24} = 1 \quad \text{(2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m #### Similarly for $C = (-a, -b)$ and $D = (-c, -d)$, the same equations hold.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So, the **diagonals are symmetric** and the **rhombus is symmetric about the origin**.
