[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 3: Use the Properties of a Rhombus
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m In a rhombus:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - All sides are equal in length.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - Diagonals intersect at right angles.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - Diagonals bisect each other.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Let’s denote the **length of diagonal $BD$** as $2d$, so that $BD^2 = 4d^2$.
