[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 2: Use the identity for the incenter and circumcenter
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m There is a known formula involving the distance between the incenter and circumcenter:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
