[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ O $ is the circumcenter,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ I $ is the incenter,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ R $ is the circumradius,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $ r $ is the inradius.
