[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the Geometry
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m A **rhombus** has:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - All sides equal in length.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - Diagonals bisect each other at right angles.
