[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Let the diagonals be:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m - $AC$ and $BD$, with $A = (a, b)$, $C = (-a, -b)$, and $B = (c, d)$, $D = (-c, -d)$
