[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Since the diagonals intersect at the origin and are perpendicular (in a rhombus), we can assume that the vectors $\vec{AC}$ and $\vec{BD}$ are perpendicular.
