[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Substitute $d^2 = \frac{1}{\frac{b^2}{20a^2} - \frac{1}{24}}$ into this expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m BD^2 = 4 \cdot \frac{1}{\frac{b^2}{20a^2} - \frac{1}{24}} \cdot \left( \frac{b^2}{a^2} + 1 \right)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Let’s simplify the expression:
