[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the notation
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m In base $ b $, the number $ 17_b $ is interpreted as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
