[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m This means that $ b + 7 $ must divide $ 9b + 7 $.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 2: Use division with remainder
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m We perform the division:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \frac{9b + 7}{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m We can write this as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m \frac{9b + 7}{b + 7} = \frac{9(b + 7) - 63 + 7}{b + 7} = 9 - \frac{56}{b + 7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m So for this to be an integer, $ \frac{56}{b + 7} $ must be an integer.
