[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m ### Step 3: Find all divisors of 56
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m Let’s list all positive divisors of 56:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=13765)[0m $$
